@startuml
title Aero_EWS 2.0 - Hybrid 4-Agent Competitive Intelligence & Early Warning Architecture

autonumber

actor "Human Analyst" as Human
participant "Web Dashboard\n(index.html / dashboard.js)" as UI
participant "FastAPI Backend\n(ews_api.py / ews_pipeline.py)" as API
participant "Agent 1: Intelligence Planning\n& Acquisition Agent" as Agent1
collections "Governed OSINT Tools\n(Exa API, FAA/EASA/NTSB,\nSEC/ESEF, OEM PR, News/Social)" as Tools
participant "FR03 Two-Stage Filter\n(Deterministic + Semantic)" as Filter
participant "Agent 2: Aviation Risk Analyst\n(Claim-First + F1-F5 Factors)" as Analyst
participant "Agent 3: Quality Assurance\nAgent (HRO Auditor)" as QA
participant "Agent 4: Executive Editor\n(Narrative & Action Plan)" as Editor
participant "Deterministic 5-Factor\nI&W Scoring (F1-F5)" as Scoring
participant "Deterministic Harness\n& KIQ Evaluator" as Harness
database "SQLite & Evidence Archive\n(ews_intelligence.db)" as DB

Human -> UI: Define KIT, time scope, sources & collection_mode
UI -> API: POST /run-ews

API -> Agent1: Deconstruct KIT into KIQPlan
Agent1 --> API: Guarded KIQPlan (BROAD / PROGRAM / EXACT)

alt collection_mode == "agentic_exa"
    loop Adaptive Acquisition Loop (bounded by AcquisitionBudget)
        Agent1 -> Tools: exa_semantic_search / search_official_regulators /\nsearch_corporate_filings / search_media_and_social
        Tools --> Agent1: Registered DOC_xxx briefs + remaining budget
        Agent1 -> Tools: inspect_collection_coverage(focus_terms)
        Tools --> Agent1: Primary/secondary counts & missing facets
    end
    Agent1 --> API: Collected DOC_xxx + AcquisitionTrace
else collection_mode == "deterministic" (Baseline)
    API -> Tools: Fixed KIQ connector orchestration
    Tools --> API: Collected DOC_xxx + Connector Telemetry
end

API -> DB: Persist source_documents (SHA-256, PII redacted, injection guarded)

API -> Filter: Two-stage relevance & identity screening (FR03)
Filter -> DB: Log accepted & excluded documents (document_filter_log)
Filter --> API: Bounded Analyst document batches

API -> Analyst: Extract candidate events & F1-F5 factor ratings
Analyst --> API: Candidate ThreatAssessments (facts vs. hypotheses)

API -> QA: Audit grounding, variant scope & F1-F5 justifications
QA --> API: QA audit findings

opt Corrective feedback enabled (EWS_ENABLE_AGENT_FEEDBACK=1)
    API -> Analyst: Bounded single-iteration correction
    Analyst --> API: Revised ThreatAssessments
    API -> QA: Recheck revised assessments
    QA --> API: Updated QA findings
end

API -> Editor: Synthesize executive summary, analysis & action plan
Editor --> API: Plain-text editorial blocks (parsed to EditorialOutput)

API -> Scoring: Compute S = round(sum(w_i * F_i) * 2)
Scoring --> API: Reproducible 1-10 scores + scoring_audit (F1-F5)

API -> Harness: 5-dimensional grounding, chronology & KIQ evaluation
Harness --> API: Validated status, confidence & confirmed-critical gate

API -> DB: Reconcile event IDs, store report, agent_decision_trace & run metrics
API --> UI: Pending report (WAITING_FOR_HITL)
UI --> Human: Present Executive/Analyst view, F1-F5 & Agent Traces

alt Report approved
    Human -> UI: Approve report (X-Review-Key)
    UI -> API: POST /approve-ews (APPROVE)
    API -> DB: Persist approval, publish dashboard_data.json & archive CSV
    API --> UI: Published report
else Report rejected
    Human -> UI: Reject report
    UI -> API: POST /approve-ews (REJECT)
    API -> DB: Record rejection decision
end

@enduml